    {
      "source": "Constructor with a fully initialized <a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "带有完全初始化的<a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a>的构造函数。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The implementation of this method for <a href=\"HttpMessageWriterView.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.view\"><code>HttpMessageWriterView</code></a>\ndelegates to <a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html#getWritableMediaTypes()\"><code>HttpMessageWriter.getWritableMediaTypes()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此方法针对<a href=\"HttpMessageWriterView.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.view\"><code>HttpMessageWriterView</code></a>的实现委托给<a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html#getWritableMediaTypes()\"><code>HttpMessageWriter.getWritableMediaTypes()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the attributes in the model that should be rendered by this view.\nWhen set, all other model attributes will be ignored. The matching\nattributes are further narrowed with <a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html#canWrite(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>HttpMessageWriter.canWrite(ResolvableType, MediaType)</code></a>.\nThe matching attributes are processed as follows:\n<ul>\n<li>0: nothing is written to the response body.\n</li><li>1: the matching attribute is passed to the writer.\n</li><li>2..N: if the writer supports <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, write all matches;\notherwise raise an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>.\n</li></ul>",
      "translation": "设置此视图应渲染的模型属性。设置后，将忽略所有其他模型属性。匹配的属性会进一步通过 <a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html#canWrite(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>HttpMessageWriter.canWrite(ResolvableType, MediaType)</code></a> 进行筛选。匹配的属性按以下方式处理：\n<ul>\n<li>0：不向响应体写入任何内容。\n</li><li>1：将匹配的属性传递给写入器。\n</li><li>2..N：如果写入器支持 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，则写入所有匹配项；否则抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。\n</li></ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>View</code> that writes model attribute(s) with an <a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于通过<a href=\"../../../../http/codec/HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a>写入模型属性（一个或多个）的<code>View</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"View.html#render(java.util.Map,org.springframework.http.MediaType,org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange)\">View</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"View.html#render(java.util.Map,org.springframework.http.MediaType,org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange)\">View</a></code></span>",
