      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Render the view based on the given <a href=\"../../HandlerResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>HandlerResult</code></a>. Implementations\ncan access and use the model or only a specific attribute in it.",
